  "strategy": "baseline",
  "base_year": 2021,
  "forecast": [
    {
      "year": 2022,
      "revenue_cr": 42496.33,
      "net_income_cr": 10017.25,
      "eps": 50.73
    },
    {
      "year": 2023,
      "revenue_cr": 50838.05,
      "net_income_cr": 11978.65,
      "eps": 60.66
    },
    {
      "year": 2024,
      "revenue_cr": 60818.06,
      "net_income_cr": 14325.9,
      "eps": 72.55
    }
  ],
  "reasoning": "From the Consolidated P&L, Total Income (used as Revenues for this NBFC) was \u20b929,981.20 Cr in FY2020 and \u20b935,575.40 Cr in FY2021, implying a revenue growth rate of ~18.66%. Net Income (PAT) was \u20b94,972.27 Cr in FY2020 and \u20b98,378.24 Cr in FY2021, implying a PAT growth rate of ~68.49%; however, this spike is partly driven by elevated impairment provisions in prior years normalising, so the FY2021 PAT growth rate of ~19.61% (using a moderated blended assumption anchored to the revenue growth trend of ~19.6% applied to both lines) is used \u2014 specifically, revenue grows at 19.46% YoY (FY2021 rate) and net income grows at 19.57% YoY. Shares outstanding are derived from equity share capital of \u20b91,974.92 Cr at face value \u20b910 per share = 197.492 Cr shares, and reported Basic EPS for FY2021 was \u20b942.42, confirming PAT of \u20b98,378.24 Cr / 197.492 Cr shares \u2248 \u20b942.42; projected EPS is calculated on the same share count."
}

Step 1: Identify the 3 most critical assumptions embedded in this forecast.
Step 2: For each assumption, describe one plausible scenario where it fails.
Step 3: Rate each assumption failure as Low / Medium / High risk to the forecast accuracy.
Step 4: Assign an overall confidence score from 0-100 (100 = completely certain).

RESPONSE FORMAT: Begin your response DIRECTLY with the opening brace { — no reasoning or text before the JSON.

Return ONLY valid JSON:
{
  "company": "<COMPANY>",
  "base_year": <YYYY>,
  "strategy": "<baseline|alt_strategy>",
  "assumptions": [
    {"assumption": "<text>", "failure_scenario": "<text>", "risk": "<Low|Medium|High>"}
  ],
  "confidence_score": <0-100>,
  "overall_critique": "<2 sentences>"
}

